## /aceopti-setup — Project onboarding

Ask ONE question at a time, wait for answer, build context snapshot, save to memory.

Questions: project type/stack/scale → current goal → in scope → constraints → consumers → definition of done.

```
/aceopti-setup          ← full interview
/aceopti-setup refresh  ← update goal + scope
/aceopti-setup show     ← print saved context
/aceopti-setup reset    ← delete
```

---

## /acesidekick — Local LLM sidekick

Route cheap tasks to local LLM. Keep reasoning here.

Delegate: summarization, log parsing, regex, template filling, docstrings, test stubs, changelog.
Keep here: bug root cause, architecture, security, complex debugging.

```
/acesidekick            ← auto
/acesidekick light      ← suggestions only
/acesidekick strict     ← offload max
/acesidekick off        ← disable
```
